    {
      "id": "ae7ace62",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 多速率系统的仿真\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5a13e7f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 多速率系统\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e5e4ce71",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**多速率系统**是指系统中存在不同采样率信号的数字系统。图中给出了最简单多速率系统的一般示意图：一个具有某种采样率的信号被输入到系统中，而在输出端则产生一个具有不同采样率的信号。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![5-1.jpg](attachment:5-1.jpg)\n\n</div>\n\n如果采样率降低，该过程称为**降采样** （或**下采样**）。如果采样率提高，该过程称为**上采样**。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-1.jpg": {
          "image/jpeg": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adb17997",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## **AnyMath**多速率信号处理模块\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3d07bded",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**AnyMath**包含以下用于更改信号采样率的模块（它们位于**信号处理** ->**信号处理**库中）：\n* **Downsample** 模块将输入信号降采样为`M`的倍数（其中`M`是正整数），并舍弃中间值。\n\n<center>\n\n![5-2.png](attachment:5-2.png)\n\n</center>\n\n* 该模块将每个输入元素视为一个独立通道，并对每个通道分别进行降采样。输出采样率比输入采样率低`M`倍，其中`M`是参数**降采样因子，M**的值。**Downsample** 模块对输入信号进行降采样，在输出每个值后舍弃`M-1`个值。\n  \n* **Upsample** 模块通过在相邻输入信号值之间插入`L-1`个0值，将输入信号各通道的采样率提高`L`倍（其中`L`为正整数），其中`L`是参数**Upsample factor, L**的值。\n\n<center>\n\n![5-3.png](attachment:5-3.png)\n\n</center>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-3.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "518b73e8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 提高采样率\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "391cafb9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a97f8346",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在此任务中，您将生成一个频率为 $100$ Hz、采样时间为 $0.001$ s 的正弦信号。使用 **Upsample** 模块，将信号采样率提高 $5$ 倍。\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。向模型中添加一个 **DSP Sine Wave** 模块。在模块设置窗口中，将 **Frequency** 的值设置为 `100` Hz，并将 **Sample time** 参数设置为 `1/1000`。\n2. 向模型中添加一个 **Upsample** 模块。在模块设置窗口中，将 **Upsample factor, L** 的值设置为 `5`。\n3. 将 **Terminator** 模块添加到模型中。\n4. 将这三个模块串联起来。\n5. 记录原始信号和重采样后的信号。\n6. 在模型设置窗口中，将仿真时间设置为 `0.1` 秒，步长设置为 `1/5000`（比原始信号的采样时间小 $5$ 倍）。\n7. 在模型设置窗口的 **Debugging** 选项卡中，在 **Information display** 部分选择 **Signal sampling rate** 和 **Highlighting**。\n8. 运行模型。将记录的信号绘制在不同的图形画布上。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-4.png](attachment:5-4.png)\n\n</center>\n\n原始正弦波的图形：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-5.png](attachment:5-5.png)\n\n</center>\n\n采样率提高 $5$ 倍后的正弦波波形：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-6.png](attachment:5-6.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-4.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-5.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-6.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f973c0df",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 降低采样率\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9d887c26",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a56990a2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "将正弦信号的采样率降低 $3$ 倍。为此，请执行以下步骤：\n\n1. 从模型中移除 **Upsample** 模块。\n2. 在模型中添加一个 **Downsample** 模块来替换它。在模块设置窗口中，将 **Downsample factor, M** 的值设置为 `3`。\n3. 记录 **Downsample** 模块的输出。\n5. 运行模型。绘制重采样后的信号波形。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-7.png](attachment:5-7.png)\n\n</center>\n\n采样率降低 $3$ 倍后的正弦波波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-8.png](attachment:5-8.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-7.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-8.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fd13b5aa",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 改变采样率引发的问题\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e2d09e80",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "降低采样率可能会导致一个问题：我们可能无法满足奈奎斯特-香农定理的条件。我们是在不同尺度的离散时间采样点上对信号进行采样。由于混叠效应，可能会丢失数据，从而无法重建原始信号。因此，在实际应用中，通常采用预滤波降采样方法，以确保符合奈奎斯特-香农定理的条件。\n\n要实现这一点，只需将信号通过一个截止频率不超过输出降采样信号采样率一半的低通滤波器即可。滤波后，必须执行降采样操作。该方案可确保避免混叠。此类滤波器被称为**抗混叠**滤波器。\n\n![даунсэмплинг.jpg](attachment:даунсэмплинг.jpg)\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "даунсэмплинг.jpg": {
          "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0f1333d8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "提高采样率同样需要使用滤波器，但在此情况下，其作用是抑制落在扩展奈奎斯特区内的信号频谱副本。该滤波器称为**抗成像**滤波器。\r\n\r\n![апсэмплинг с фильтрацией.jpg](attachment:апсэмплинг с фильтрацией.jpg)\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "апсэмплинг с фильтрацией.jpg": {
          "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "68e639c6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ">**标准插值方案**：首先进行提高采样率（插入0值），随后使用反成像滤波器进行滤波。在时域中，信号被平滑处理，正极性和负极性值向0值的陡峭过渡被平均掉。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "390879ef",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 按分数因子改变采样率\r\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28a45df1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "如果需要按分数因子改变采样率，可以通过结合按整数因子进行插值和降采样操作来实现。系数$L/M$的比值将给出采样率变化因子的分数值。首先，以因子$L$进行插值，随后进行低通滤波（使用单一滤波器同时实现反成像和抗混叠），最后以因子$M$进行降采样。低通滤波器的截止频率应始终设置为两者中的较低值。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![5-9.jpg](attachment:5-9.jpg)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-9.jpg": {
          "image/jpeg": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e998d57a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "70397c22",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "将正弦信号的采样率提高 $5/3$ 倍。为此，请修改上一任务中构建的模型：\n\n1. 将 **Upsample** 模块添加到模型中。将其连接在 **DSP Sine Wave** 和 **Downsample** 模块之间。\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，将参数 **Upsample factor, L** 的值设置为 `5`。\n3. 运行模型。绘制重采样后的信号波形。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-10.png](attachment:5-10.png)\n\n</center>\n\n采样率按 $5/3$ 倍改变后的正弦波波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-11.png](attachment:5-11.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-10.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-11.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "740d1485",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 过采样信号的重采样 \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c2d91df1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "奈奎斯特-香农定理指出，为了准确重建原始数据，采样率必须至少是信号最大频率的两倍。\n\n如果数据已被过采样（即采样率超过最低要求），那么即使满足奈奎斯特-香农定理的条件，所消耗的资源（如带宽）也会超过准确表示原始信号所必需的量。为了节省资源，可以将采样率降低到更合理的水平。 «可接受性»标准取决于具体情况。例如，由于人类听觉范围的限制，音频应用通常使用的带宽范围为$20$ Hz至$20$ kHz。 \n\n例如，假设您的数据由频率为$8$ kHz的正弦波组成，采样率为$30$ kHz。您的目标是对该数据进行重采样操作，使其频率变为$20$ kHz。请注意，根据采样理论，$20$ kHz大于$2 \\cdot 8=16$ kHz。\n\n信号的采样率只能按整数倍进行调整。如果您希望像本例中那样，将采样率从$30$ kHz微调至$20$ kHz，则必须对信号数据进行另一次采样率转换。重采样是指先进行提高采样率，再进行降采样，从而以分数倍率转换采样率的过程。为避免数据信息丢失，必须始终先进行提高采样率，然后进行降采样。\n\n若要将采样率从$30$ kHz更改为$20$ kHz，您需要减小该分数：\n\n$$20/30 = 2/3.$$ \n\n因此，$L=2$，$M=3$。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "66224085",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务4\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7ff26eda",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在此任务中，您将生成一个频率为 $8$ kHz、采样率为 $30$ kHz 的正弦信号，然后将采样率调整为原来的 $2/3$。为此，请修改上一任务中创建的模型：\n\n1. 在 **DSP Sine Wave** 模块的设置窗口中，将 **Frequency** 的值设置为 `8000` Hz，并将 **Sample time** 的值设置为 `1/30000`。\n2. 在 **Upsample** 模块的设置窗口中，将 **Upsample factor, L** 的值设置为 `2`。\n3. 在模型设置窗口中，将仿真时间设置为 `10` 秒，步长设置为 `1/30000/3/2`（即模型采样率是原始正弦波采样率以及系数 $L$ 和 $M$ 的整数倍）。\n4. 运行模型。在频域中绘制重采样后的信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-12.png](attachment:5-12.png)\n\n</center>\n\n采样率按 $2/3$ 倍改变后的正弦波频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-13.png](attachment:5-13.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-12.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-13.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f02f15d0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "该信号频谱中显示了一个对应于原始$8$ kHz正弦波的峰值，以及一个位于$22$ kHz处的峰值。\n\n一个$8$ kHz的正弦波其频率范围为$±8$ kHz。由于数字信号的频谱总是在每个采样率处（即每$30$ kHz）重复，因此在频率为$30$ kHz的整数倍处会出现频谱复本，即\n\n<center>\n\n...,$–38$ kHz,$–22$ kHz,$–8$ kHz,$8$ kHz,$22$ kHz,$38$ kHz....\n\n</center>\n\n这就是为什么您可以在$22$ kHz处观察到频谱镜像。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4e0d38d0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 抗混叠滤波器的设计与应用\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5061bbb1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "要正确地将 $8$ kHz 的正弦波从 $30$ kHz 上采样到 $60$ kHz，您需要在上采样操作后去除 $22$ kHz 处的频谱镜像。这可以通过使用 **anti-aliasing** 低通滤波器实现，以去除超出原始信号通带的频谱镜像。\n\n该低通滤波器必须满足以下要求：\n\n* 滤波器必须在提高后的采样率下工作。在此示例中，采样率为 $60$ kHz。\n* 滤波器截止频率必须确保移除高于两个奈奎斯特频率中较低者（即原始奈奎斯特频率和降采样后的最终奈奎斯特频率）的频率，以防止降采样操作导致混叠。在此示例中，初始奈奎斯特频率为 $30/2=15$ kHz，重采样后的最终奈奎斯特频率为 $20/2=10$ kHz。因此，滤波器截止频率必须为 10 kHz。\n\n要设计抗混叠滤波器，您将使用 **Filter Designer** 应用程序；要实现抗成像滤波器，则使用 **Discrete FIR Filter** 模块。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "077246f9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4d75e5a0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用 **Filter Designer** 应用程序设计一个抗成像滤波器：\n\n1. 打开 **Filter Designer** 应用程序。\n\n2. 设置以下滤波器参数值：\n\n   * **Filter Frequency Response Type** - `Low-pass filter`;\n   * **Filter synthesis method** - `FIR`, `Uniform`;\n   * **Filter order** - `Minimum order`;\n   * **Frequency grid density** - `20`。\n\n   频率要求：\n\n   * **Unit** - `Hz`；\n   * **Sampling frequency Fs** - `60e3`；\n   * **Passband frequency Fpass** - `9e3`；\n   * **Stopband frequency Fstop** - `11e3`。\n\n   幅值要求：\n\n   * **Units** - `dB`；\n   * **Ripple (Apass)** - `1`；\n   * **Attenuation (Astop)** - `80.`\n\n3. 点击 **Filter synthesis** 按钮。\n\n4. 点击 **Filter Coefficients** 按钮。将分子系数保存到计算机中，文件名为 `num.txt`。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n<center>\n\n![4 задание 5.png](attachment:4 задание 5.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4 задание 5.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "31b276d0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "29ed01bd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "完成该模型：\n\n1. 将 **Discrete FIR Filter** 模块添加到模型中。将其连接在 **Upsample** 和 **Downsample** 模块之间。\n2. 从 `num.txt` 文件中复制滤波器系数向量，并将其粘贴到 **Discrete FIR Filter** 模块设置窗口中的 **Coefficients** 字段。请注意，向量的各元素需用方括号 `[...]` 括起。\n4. 运行模型。在频域中绘制重采样后的信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-14.png](attachment:5-14.png)\n\n</center>\n\n采样率按 $2/3$ 倍改变后的正弦波频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![5-15.png](attachment:5-15.png)\n\n</center>\n\n从图中可以看到，$22$ kHz 处没有信号的频谱副本，但在 $2$ kHz 处（$-8+10=2$ kHz）存在一个衰减的频谱副本。\n\n频谱副本的衰减程度由滤波器阻带决定。阻带内衰减越大，频谱副本的强度越弱。\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5-14.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5-15.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
